The Wild Olive Guesthouse offers dependable business accommodation in Centurion for corporate travellers who need a practical, well-equipped base.&nbsp; Located in Clubview, this 4-star guesthouse provides 16 stylish rooms with everything required for productive work and rest.

Rooms feature a desk and workspace, complimentary high-speed WiFi, air-conditioning, mini-fridge, microwave, tea and coffee facilities, iron and ironing board, flat-screen TV with selected DSTV channels, and en-suite bathrooms.&nbsp; Most rooms offer super king beds that can convert to twins.

Guests benefit from free secure off-street parking, solar power with battery and generator backup for uninterrupted electricity, and daily breakfast (packs available for early departures).&nbsp; Dinners can be arranged on request, and an air-conditioned conference facility seating up to 45 is available for meetings.

Conveniently positioned as accommodation near Centurion business parks, offices and the CBD, The Wild Olive is a strong choice for short-stay business accommodation, work-friendly stays, and corporate travellers seeking a guesthouse with WiFi, workspace and reliable backup power in Centurion.
